---
// Verbatim Authentic Content & Media from Khao Sok Riverside Cottages
import PageLayout from '../../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

---

<PageLayout
  title="Khao Sok Activities"
  description="Khao Sok Activities Discover more with our Khao Sok FAQs"
  heroImage="/images/khao-sok-hero-cottages.jpg"
  heroTitle="Khao Sok Activities"
  heroSubtitle="The Ancient Rainforest of Southern Thailand"
  breadcrumbs={[{"label": "Faq Category", "href": "/faq-category/"}, {"label": "Khao Sok Activities", "href": "/faq-category/khao-sok-activities/"}]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <div class="bg-[#faf8f5]/95 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#12281b]/10 pb-4 mb-8 font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] font-medium uppercase text-[#163824]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <span class="text-[#7a5813]">KSR</span>
          <span class="text-[#12281b]/20">/</span>
          <span>FIELD DISPATCH</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[#7a5813] font-bold">KHAO SOK · THAILAND</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">

        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Is Tam Kaew Cave safe to visit?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Yes, when visited with experienced guides. Visitor numbers are limited and guides lead all cave explorations to ensure safety and protect the cave environment.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>What should I bring on the tour?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          We recommend trekking shoes, insect repellent, water, swimwear and a small waterproof bag for valuables.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Where is Khlong Phanom National Park?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Khlong Phanom National Park is located about 30–40 minutes from Khao Sok village in Surat Thani Province, southern Thailand.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>How long does the Cave, Raft & Hike tour take?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The experience typically lasts 5–6 hours, including bamboo rafting, jungle hiking, cave exploration and lunch.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Is the Cave, Raft & Hike tour suitable for beginners?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Yes. The tour is moderately active, but most visitors with basic fitness can participate. The jungle hike includes uneven terrain and short climbs.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Can you swim in Khao Sok?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Yes, both Cheow Larn Lake and the local river by Khao Sok Riverside Cottages are safe and enjoyable.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>How can I book Khao Sok tours?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          For the best availability, you can book tours as part of a package deal when you book your accommodation. You can also talk with the front desk staff when you arrive and they can book all your tours. Khao Sok Riverside Cottages have a wealth of information including less well known, off the beaten track Khao Sok tours. Find out more ...
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Is Khao Sok a good place for kids?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Khao Sok is a family friendly destination. Many of the river and jungle experiences are gentle and suitable for children. Khao Sok Riverside Cottages can help you find activities that will be enjoyable for the whole family. Find out more ..
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>What are the best things to do in Khao Sok?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          You can enjoy Khao Sok from the water with lake trips, river tubing, and canoe tours. You can also trek through the jungle, enjoy a night safari, bathe elephants, relax with a massage, and learn jungle cooking. These are some of the best things to do in Khao Sok.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>How do you explore Khao Sok?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          You can explore some of Khao Sok on your own, but the best experience is to go with a local guide. They will be able to point out wildlife and give you interesting facts about the area.
        </p>
      </div>

      
    </div>
  </article>
</PageLayout>
